  "faq": [
    {
      "question": "What is Cuffe Parade known for?",
      "answer": "Cuffe Parade is known as one of Mumbai's most exclusive residential addresses - a reclaimed land peninsula at the southernmost tip of South Mumbai, home to Maker Towers, the World Trade Centre, Badhwar Park, the Mantralaya fringe and some of the most expensive sea-facing apartments in India. It is a quiet, green, ultra-premium enclave with stunning views of the Arabian Sea and Back Bay."
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the pin code of Cuffe Parade?",
      "answer": "Cuffe Parade uses the pin code 400005 - one of South Mumbai's most prestigious postal codes."
    },
    {
      "question": "What are the sub-areas within Cuffe Parade?",
      "answer": "The main micro-localities within Cuffe Parade are Maker Towers, World Trade Centre (WTC), Badhwar Park, Colaba Woods fringe, Mantralaya fringe, Cuffe Parade Main Road and the sea-facing residential towers along the Back Bay reclamation."
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the property price in Cuffe Parade?",
      "answer": "Cuffe Parade is one of Mumbai's most expensive residential markets. Sea-facing apartments in Maker Towers and premium towers range from ₹8–25 Cr for a 3BHK. Rental rates for sea-facing 3BHKs range from ₹1.5–4 lakh per month. Non-sea-facing units are relatively more affordable at ₹5–12 Cr (as of June 2026)."
    },
    {
      "question": "How to commute from Cuffe Parade?",
      "answer": "Cuffe Parade is served by the Churchgate railway station (Western Railway, 15 minutes by taxi/auto), CST (Central Railway, 20 minutes), and Metro Line 3's Cuffe Parade station - the southernmost station on the line. BEST bus routes 1, 3 and 6 connect Cuffe Parade to Colaba, Fort and the rest of South Mumbai."
    },
    {
      "question": "Which hospitals are near Cuffe Parade?",
      "answer": "Major hospitals near Cuffe Parade include Bombay Hospital (Marine Lines), Breach Candy Hospital, Wockhardt Hospital, Saifee Hospital and St. George's Hospital (Fort). The area also has several specialist clinics and nursing homes."
    },
    {
      "question": "Which schools are near Cuffe Parade?",
      "answer": "Notable schools near Cuffe Parade include Cathedral & John Connon School (Fort), Bombay Scottish School (Mahim), St. Xavier's High School (Fort), Campion School (Cooperage) and the Cuffe Parade Municipal School."
    },
    {
      "question": "How do I find the best dentists in Cuffe Parade?",
      "answer": "Browse Mumbai96's Cuffe Parade listings, read reviews from locals and call directly. Our verified directory makes it easy to find the right dentist near Maker Towers, WTC or Badhwar Park."
    }
